{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人楊茜堯、馬國明、陳展鵬、陳自瑤、傅嘉莉等今日（8日）出席無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》宣傳活動，眾演員乘電車巡遊，站在電車上層的楊茜堯大叫「好大風」，之後她更唱出近期翻Hit的《季候風》，她又呼籲市民頒獎禮投票給《玫瑰戰爭》。</p><p>當演員由銅鑼灣鬧市</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.674968+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:02:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:56:08.445530+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"38535aca618ed084710bf0ec4b96496d0c9032fce50644a7a3ca58a0e146cc2c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}